 aylor and "The Beach Boys"' Dennis Wilson)\, with a hitchhiker in tow (Lau
 rie Bird)\, race Warren Oates and his GTO across the southern United State
 s in Monte Hellman’s masterpiece\, perhaps the greatest road film ever m
 ade.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/the-open-road/two-lane-bl
 acktop\n\nEstimated start: 19:15
